# =============================================================================
# .gitignore — pattern rules, by section:
#   1. Dependencies and build caches
#   2. Secrets and local environment
#   3. Python
#   4. OS, editor and log detritus
#   5. Session scratch
# NOT ignored, deliberately: dist/ (COMMITTED build output, written on main by
# .github/workflows/build-dist.yml only — rule 11 [R-DIST]) and data/ (the CSV
# catalog plus the generated-but-committed manifest.json, which Pages needs
# because it has no directory listing). dist/data/ IS ignored: it exists only
# when a local Pages-style copy (`cp -r data dist/data`) was made.
# =============================================================================

# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 1. Dependencies and build caches — `npm ci` and Vite recreate all of these.
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
node_modules/
dist/data/
.vite/
.svelte-kit/
coverage/

# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 2. Secrets and local environment — never commit credentials. Keys resolve at
#    runtime from a local, untracked .env; commit a keys-only .env.example.
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 3. Python — scripts/ and tools/ are stdlib; a venv exists only for the one-off
#    scripts/convert_keeper_bundle.py (pyarrow) and lives outside the tree.
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
.venv/
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 4. OS, editor and log detritus.
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
.DS_Store
*.log

# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 5. Session scratch — anything a session wants to keep goes in docs/records/
#    (rule 16 [R-RECORDS]) or a fixture, never in a scratch dir.
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
/scratch*/
.claude/worktrees/
